Modding a game can break it, corrupt saves, cause crashes, or breach the game's or a platform's terms of service. Back up your game and your saves before you use the Software. You use it at your own risk.

The Software's Uninstall function removes the loader files and the whole mods folder of the selected game installation, including mods that did not come from this Software.

